Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,H_ms,,0,0,0,,"Saya ada SISTEM." Belum sesiapa percaya...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.30,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.99,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya ada SISTEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.00,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sistem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.62,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sistem ketenteraan rahasaan luar negara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.74,S_ms,,0,0,0,,atau sistem awak buat sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.68,S_ms,,0,0,0,,yang diejar kuasa asing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.62,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.56,S_ms,,0,0,0,,SISTEM sebenarnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Macam dalam novel web —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.86,S_ms,,0,0,0,,check-in dapat kereta mewah dan banglo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.80,S_ms,,0,0,0,,poin skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.46,S_ms,,0,0,0,,jenis yang jadikan awak insan super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:17.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kamu ketawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.92,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya terlatih secara profesional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.36,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sepandai-pandai lucu, saya tak akan ketawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.86,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jadi maksud awak ialah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.84,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak ada sistem macam itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:24.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.72,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ia muncul tiba-tiba bulan lepas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:26.72,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tapi rasanya banyak bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.84,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Banyak teks rosak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Misi yang diberi pelik-pelik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.00,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Misi siap dapat pelbagai ganjaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.20,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Yang awal menguatkan tubuh saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Tapi saya tak boleh buktikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:34.24,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau gagal misi macam mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.18,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau gagal...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.56,S_ms,,0,0,0,,ia bunuh saya dengan sekeluarga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.49,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Delusi dianiaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:40.43,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Biar dia tenang dulu.
